## Get Package Data
<span class="badge bg-success">Anonymous</span>

### Get Package Metadata (Composer v2)
**Preferred method** - always up to date and efficient.

```http
GET https://repo.packagist.org/p2/[vendor]/[package].json
```

**Important notes:**
- Use `If-Modified-Since` headers for caching
- Requires decompression using `composer/metadata-minifier` package
- For dev releases, use `p2/[vendor]/[package]~dev.json`

**Response:**
```json
{
  "packages": {
    "[vendor]/[package]": [
      {
        "name": "[vendor]/[package]",
        "description": "[description]",
        "version": "[version1]"
      }
    ]
  },
  "minified": "composer/2.0"
}
```

**Examples:**
- Tagged releases: https://repo.packagist.org/p2/monolog/monolog.json
- Dev releases: https://repo.packagist.org/p2/monolog/monolog~dev.json

